星鸣（Starling）二开说明 / Notice for the Starling derivative
崇云科技二开说明 / Notice for the Chongyun Technology derivative

This build is a derivative work of "magpie" (https://github.com/yetone/magpie),
which is distributed under the MIT License reproduced above. The MIT License
requires that this notice be kept in all copies or substantial portions of
the software; the original copyright notice and the MIT License text are
retained above and are not modified.

Modifications made by 崇云科技 (Chongyun Technology) include, among others:

  * Branding: the product name, the logo, the application icons and the
    user-facing texts were replaced with 星鸣 / Starling. The product is
    Starling; 崇云科技 (Chongyun Technology) is the company behind it and
    the copyright holder of these modifications.
  * Telemetry: the daily usage-report to the upstream project's PostHog
    project was removed (internal/stats). This build reports nothing to
    any third party.
  * Official infrastructure: the update feed, the partners list, the icon
    proxy, the website and the CORS allow-list for the upstream site's
    pages were removed or made configurable by this build.
  * Subscription accounts: the whole layer that read the sign-ins of other
    agents (Claude Code, Codex, the Keychain) or imported another app's
    login files was removed. This build reads no other agent's sign-in.
    Accounts signed into through Starling itself (the Codex PKCE flow, the
    Copilot device code, Google OAuth) are unaffected.
  * The upstream project's website (site/) was removed.
  * The developer documentation under docs/ was translated into Chinese;
    the cross-references between its pages were kept working.

The MIT License grants the right to use, copy, modify, merge, publish,
distribute, sublicense and sell this software. This software is provided
"AS IS", without warranty of any kind. The names of the copyright holders
are not used to endorse or promote products derived from this software
without prior written permission.

